      {
        "id": 68305,
        "name": "w00dy",
        "username": "w00dy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/w00dy/{size}/2771_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-22T10:37:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sup guys! Since I spent so much of the con at the booth I figured I'd actually join the community. Thanks to you guys for coming down here and letting me sit at your tables playing sentinels all day! (and thanks to hanna for bringing me over to your booth)</p><p><span>It was a great way to meet people, and we walked away with a bunch of sentinels gear, from a combination of purchasing, earning, auctioning, and gifting.</span></p><p>I had an excellent time at pax, and it is primarily thanks to you lot. Thank you, guys, and I hope to see you all again next year!</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:46:34.421Z",
