        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for a great couple of days at the booth, played more games of sentinels than I can count.&nbsp;</p><p><span>w00dy and i happily left the booth with a Young Legacy Card, thanks&nbsp;</span><span>Christopher for putting that up to auction. Hope to see you again next year. (Tim Tams available on request)</span></p>",
