        "id": 68315,
        "name": "ax0r",
        "username": "ax0r",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-25T11:32:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There are probably no more than a few copies of this card in the entire country.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I can account for two of them. (/gloat)</p>\n<p>Congrats to the winners, and congrats to the &gt;G team on a successful (albeit loss-leader) con. Looking forward to seeing you back next year - With GSF there'll be at least two IPs to sell, and lots of game.</p>\n<p>One of these days I'll have enough free time to actually be useful over on the playtesting forums, but in the mean time I will continue to support by owning all of the things.</p>",
